<view class="page inbox-page" style="padding-top:{{safeTop}}px"><demo-panel/><button class="back-link" bindtap="goBack">← 回小店</button><view class="eyebrow">THE PUPPY HAS NEWS</view><view class="page-title">小狗的新消息</view><view class="page-sub">{{unreadCount ? '有 ' + unreadCount + ' 条新动态等你拆开。' : '最近的温柔，都替你收在这里。'}}</view><view class="inbox-tools"><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">{{loading ? '取信中…' : '刷新 ↻'}}</button><button wx:if="{{unreadCount}}" bindtap="readAll">全部标为已读 ✓</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-text">{{error}}</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="notice paper-card {{item.readAt ? '' : 'unread'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openNotice"><view class="notice-title"><text wx:if="{{!item.readAt}}" class="unread-dot"></text>{{item.title}}</view><view class="notice-summary">{{item.summary}}</view><view class="notice-meta"><text>{{item.dateText}}</text><text>{{item.kind === 'wish' ? '打开纸条' : (item.kind === 'daily' ? '看看今日问题' : '去小店看看')}} →</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length && !loading && !error}}" class="empty-state paper-card">信箱还安安静静的。另一半的新心愿、回信、心情和相册动态会出现在这里。</view><view class="inbox-note">保留最近 50 条；进入或回到小程序时刷新。完整心愿记录仍在“小纸条”。</view></view>
